at - never a dull moment!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le06ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Too bad you weren't there!", "type": "name"}, {"content": "I'm sorry you weren't there", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The party was fun - too bad you weren't there!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le06ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Negative of the Past Tense of To Be", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To make a negative statement in the past, you use the words <span class=\"italic\">never, not</span> or the letters <span class=\"italic\">n't</span> after the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She wasn't happy.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You were not at the party.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "There was never a dull moment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"03\",\"columns\":\"04\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Long Form </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Short Form</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I<br />He<br />She \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> was not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> wasn't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> there yesterday.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We <br />You <br />They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> were not\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> weren't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<br /> interested in the party.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About a Work Party", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can ask about a work party using the Past tense of the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span>. <br /> You can describe a work party using adjectives after the verb <span class=\"strong\">to be</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Qualities</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How was the work party? <br />How was it?  <br /> Was the work party nice?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It was interesting. <br />It wasn't bad. <br />Yes! There was never a dull moment. <br />Too bad you weren't there!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn1le06ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Practice the dialogue in this takeaway with your partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Underline the adjectives after the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a new dialogue with your partner and talk about a party.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the past tense of the verb <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> in the negative.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your dialogue in class. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use the Past tense of <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> in the negative. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue about a party. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue with a partner. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}